{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Go To Hell",
    "steam_appid": 3607710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/71489c18ef2288db00086997e59b884f.webp?t=1746484718\" width=100 height=41 /></span><strong>Everything Has a Beginning!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/45e0fa67c91109537c3c06f41b1bd75e.webp?t=1746484718\" width=100 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once upon a time in a far, far away kingdom...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait a minute! This isn\u2019t a fairy tale. There\u2019s no magic to fix problems, no guaranteed happy endings. This is a game about reality\u2014harsh, raw, and with no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dear <strong>Chico Chifrudo\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/6761c434cdb252dbf2f97f508bc4d280.webp?t=1746484718\" width=60 height=56 /></span> has always been a rebellious soul, but this time, he really outdid himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless pranks in Hell\u2014including turning the <strong>Almighty Trident</strong> into a mere barbecue skewer\u2014\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/db2900a9389501bada9a470887028e72.webp?t=1746484718\" width=41 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Lord of Darkness\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/00aeb966e8add71020c84cc956ac93e4.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=73 /></span> finally lost his patience. Without thinking twice, he banished our mischievous little demon, condemning him to wander between worlds like an unemployed outcast of the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But\u2026 OOPS! Something went terribly wrong!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this cosmic mess, three <strong>extremely dangerous souls\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span> also managed to escape. Now, they are wreaking havoc on Earth\u2014fires everywhere, cities in ruins, pure chaos that would make the Apocalypse look like a peaceful Sunday afternoon. And, of course, the <strong>Almighty One up there</strong> is not happy about this disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, He declared:\u00a0<strong>Either the Lord of Darkness fixes this in a week, or Hell will be CANCELED forever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/3b98a8b33a2e47d6c9597c87d320c4e8.webp?t=1746484718\" width=60 height=49 /></span>Desperate and out of options, the Lord of Darkness has no choice but to rely on his only\u2014and worst\u2014hope: <strong>Chico Chifrudo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the very troublemaker who caused all this mess must now clean it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must race against time, face absurd challenges, and hunt down these escaped souls before Earth turns into a literal Hell. But hold on! Nothing will be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will <strong>Chico Chifrudo</strong> save the day, or will he only make things worse? Well\u2026 there's only one way to find out\u2014<strong>play the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>GOOD LUCK!</strong> \ud83d\udd25 (You\u2019re gonna need it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>isometric platformer</strong> with <strong>cute graphics</strong> brings RPG elements, a <strong>death counter</strong> (for obvious reasons), and just the right amount of difficulty to make you <strong>question your life choices.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/71489c18ef2288db00086997e59b884f.webp?t=1746484718\" width=100 height=41 /></span><strong>Everything Has a Beginning!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/45e0fa67c91109537c3c06f41b1bd75e.webp?t=1746484718\" width=100 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once upon a time in a far, far away kingdom...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait a minute! This isn\u2019t a fairy tale. There\u2019s no magic to fix problems, no guaranteed happy endings. This is a game about reality\u2014harsh, raw, and with no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dear <strong>Chico Chifrudo\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/6761c434cdb252dbf2f97f508bc4d280.webp?t=1746484718\" width=60 height=56 /></span> has always been a rebellious soul, but this time, he really outdid himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless pranks in Hell\u2014including turning the <strong>Almighty Trident</strong> into a mere barbecue skewer\u2014\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/db2900a9389501bada9a470887028e72.webp?t=1746484718\" width=41 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Lord of Darkness\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/00aeb966e8add71020c84cc956ac93e4.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=73 /></span> finally lost his patience. Without thinking twice, he banished our mischievous little demon, condemning him to wander between worlds like an unemployed outcast of the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But\u2026 OOPS! Something went terribly wrong!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this cosmic mess, three <strong>extremely dangerous souls\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/5b074c7909d3c62f8548f37b75cc4c43.webp?t=1746484718\" width=45 height=56 /></span> also managed to escape. Now, they are wreaking havoc on Earth\u2014fires everywhere, cities in ruins, pure chaos that would make the Apocalypse look like a peaceful Sunday afternoon. And, of course, the <strong>Almighty One up there</strong> is not happy about this disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, He declared:\u00a0<strong>Either the Lord of Darkness fixes this in a week, or Hell will be CANCELED forever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607710/extras/3b98a8b33a2e47d6c9597c87d320c4e8.webp?t=1746484718\" width=60 height=49 /></span>Desperate and out of options, the Lord of Darkness has no choice but to rely on his only\u2014and worst\u2014hope: <strong>Chico Chifrudo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the very troublemaker who caused all this mess must now clean it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must race against time, face absurd challenges, and hunt down these escaped souls before Earth turns into a literal Hell. But hold on! Nothing will be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will <strong>Chico Chifrudo</strong> save the day, or will he only make things worse? Well\u2026 there's only one way to find out\u2014<strong>play the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>GOOD LUCK!</strong> \ud83d\udd25 (You\u2019re gonna need it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>isometric platformer</strong> with <strong>cute graphics</strong> brings RPG elements, a <strong>death counter</strong> (for obvious reasons), and just the right amount of difficulty to make you <strong>question your life choices.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udd25 Chico Chifrudo was expelled from Hell after causing too much trouble. During his banishment, three dangerous souls escaped to Earth. Now, he must capture them before the world turns into a real hell! A platformer/isometric game with RPG elements, insane challenges, and plenty of humor! Good luck!",
